                  <annotatedElement xmi:idref="BasicDiscovery.CompositeProfile"/>
                  <body>Placeholder for the BasicDiscovery composite. All concrete classes come from the composed modules (CDIFCore, CDIFDiscovery) - this class has no instances.</body>
